    {"pellet_flow_coefficient", "coFloats", "Pellet flow coefficient", "", "", "Flow factor for pellet printers, found by testing. It is turned into an equivalent filament diameter (filament_diameter = sqrt(4 × coefficient / π)), and all other flow calculations stay the same.", "", "simple", "", "", "0", ""},
