    {"precise_outer_wall", "coBool", "Precise wall", "", "", "Adjusts the spacing of the outer wall so the part's outside is more accurate, which also makes layers more even. Ignored with the outer-inner or inner-outer-inner wall orders.", "Quality", "simple", "", "", "", ""},
